# Build-context excludes for `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .` (BuildKit reads
# this <Dockerfile>.dockerignore automatically; patterns are relative to the repo root).
# Keeps `COPY . /opt/nexussim` from dragging in git history, caches, and build junk.
.git
.github
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
.venv/
dist/
build/
img/
docs/
*.gif
*.usdz
*.ckpt
